OL,3,GNEWSADriver critically ill after crash
OL,4,Ainvolving police car in East Ayrshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver is in a critical condition in
OL,7,Fhospital after a crash involving a
OL,8,Fmarked police car and a third vehicle
OL,9,Fin East Ayrshire.
OL,11,FThe collision happened on the A76 at
OL,12,FMauchline at about 14:40 on Friday.
OL,14,FA 56-year-old man who was driving a
OL,15,FSeat Mii was taken by air ambulance to
OL,16,Fthe Queen Elizabeth University Hospital
OL,17,Fin Glasgow.
OL,19,FTwo officers in the police car and
OL,20,Fanother driver who was in a BYD Dolphin
OL,21,Fdid not require hospital treatment.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
